-- src:17985 | (2) For the purposes of this Part a body is to be regarded as “established in the United Kingdom” if and only if—
-- src:17986 | (a) it is incorporated or formed under the law of the United Kingdom or a part of the United Kingdom, or
-- src:17987 | (b) its central management and control are exercised in the United Kingdom;
-- src:17988 | and any reference to a qualification “obtained in the United Kingdom” is to a qualification obtained from such a body.
@ref s 1261(2) established in the United Kingdom, obtained in the United Kingdom (src:17985-17988)
GIVEN `the body is incorporated or formed under the law of the United Kingdom or a part of the United Kingdom` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the central management and control of the body are exercised in the United Kingdom` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 1261(2) the body is established in the United Kingdom` MEANS
    IF       `the body is incorporated or formed under the law of the United Kingdom or a part of the United Kingdom`
          OR `the central management and control of the body are exercised in the United Kingdom`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "a body is to be regarded as “established in the United Kingdom” if and only if"

GIVEN `the qualification was obtained from a body established in the United Kingdom` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 1261(2) the qualification was obtained in the United Kingdom` MEANS
    IF `the qualification was obtained from a body established in the United Kingdom`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "any reference to a qualification “obtained in the United Kingdom” is to a qualification obtained from such a body"

