GIVEN e IS A `s 1262 expression`
GIVETH A STRING
`s 1262 the provision that defines or explains the expression` MEANS
    CONSIDER e
    WHEN `s 1262 expression: address` THEN "section 1261(1)" -- table row at src:17995
    WHEN `s 1262 expression: appropriate qualification` THEN "section 1219" -- table row at src:17996
    WHEN `s 1262 expression: approved third country competent authority` THEN "section 1240B(1);" -- table row at src:17997
